<human_speech><blue>New arc. Same interface, different adversary. Nobody wrote this one, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>.<\blue><green>It is the best of thirty-two candidates, after twenty generations of being scored against everything in the catalogue.<\green><blue>Scored on what, exactly?<\blue><green>On winning. Nothing else. It has no habits we gave it. Find the ones it grew.<\green><\human_speech>
